### Создать запчасть
POST http://localhost:8080/api/parts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Motor Oil 10w-40 Fuchs",
  "sku": "Fchs1040",
  "article": "0986494127",
  "description": "Synthetic motor oil",
  "price": 5400.00,
  "manufacturerId": 3,
  "categoryId": 3
}

###
